**`web/src/hooks/useMemoQueries.ts`; `memoServiceClient`**

The module wraps every memo operation in a React Query hook, all routed through the one client: reads via `useMemos` and `useInfiniteMemos` (`listMemos`), `useMemo` (`getMemo`), `useMemoComments` and `useInfiniteMemoComments` (`listMemoComments`), and `useLinkMetadata` (`getLinkMetadata`); writes via `useCreateMemo` (`createMemo`, line 178), `useUpdateMemo` (`updateMemo`, line 197), and `useDeleteMemo` (`deleteMemo`, line 253).

